meta {
  name: all-drugs
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/inventory/drugs/all
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # All Drugs

  Returns every active drug in the authenticated workspace as an unpaginated collection for local search and selection controls.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership.

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "All drugs fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "drugs": [
        {
          "id": "drug-uuid",
          "name": "Amoxil",
          "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
          "strength": "500 mg",
          "form": "Capsule",
          "unit": "Pack",
          "isActive": true
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Only active workspace drugs are returned.
  - Results are ordered by brand name.
  - Use `GET /inventory/drugs/list` for server search and pagination.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Drug retrieval failed unexpectedly. |
}
